  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ashok Kumar Shukla (Sharma) vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 19 November, 2018 The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh M.Cr.C. No.46189/2018 (Ashok Shukla (Sharma) Vs. State of M.P.) Gwalior, dated : 19.11.2018",
    "facts": "The Food Safety Officer ought to have filed private complaint as per provisions contained in Section 420 of IPC. Therefore, he be given the benefit of anticipatory bail.",
    "arguments": "Learned Public Prosecutor for the respondent/State opposed the prayer and submits on the basis of case diary that the case is serious in nature because applicant was involved in preparation of milk, milk products from urea and other chemicals.",
